Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.32,0:23:20.16,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}すさんでゆく　それでも立ってる
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.35,0:23:26.07,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}胸を刺す　この寂しさよ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.20,0:23:31.92,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}点も線も　途切れ途切れに
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.92,0:23:34.99,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}仮面は割れて
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.99,0:23:37.95,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}やり過ごせないもの
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.95,0:23:40.97,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}生きてかなくちゃ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.97,0:23:45.66,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}明日が待ち迎えてる
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.66,0:23:51.25,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果てしなくて　儚いね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.25,0:23:57.42,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}心なんて　どこにも　ないと思えばいい
Dialogue: 1,0:23:57.65,0:24:00.68,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}まぶしくて
Dialogue: 1,0:24:00.68,0:24:04.73,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}柔らかい手のひら
Dialogue: 1,0:24:04.73,0:24:13.01,Jigoku_ED2JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}あの日　握り返した
Comment: 0,0:23:05.16,0:23:08.16,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 2,0:23:08.16,0:23:14.21,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}在另一侧 今天仍有人
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.32,0:23:20.16,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}日渐颓败 却仍然站立
Dialogue: 2,0:23:20.35,0:23:26.07,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}刺痛胸口的这份寂寞
Dialogue: 2,0:23:26.20,0:23:31.92,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}点或是线 断断续续
Dialogue: 2,0:23:31.92,0:23:34.99,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}面具碎裂
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.99,0:23:37.95,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}那无法回避的一切
Dialogue: 2,0:23:37.95,0:23:40.97,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}不得不活下去
Dialogue: 2,0:23:40.97,0:23:45.66,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H050505&\3c&HDDDDDD&}明天已经在等待
Dialogue: 2,0:23:45.66,0:23:51.25,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}无边无际 却又如此短暂
Dialogue: 2,0:23:51.25,0:23:57.42,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}就当作心这种东西 根本不存在吧
Dialogue: 2,0:23:57.65,0:24:00.68,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}耀眼得难以直视
Dialogue: 2,0:24:00.68,0:24:04.73,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}柔软的手心
Dialogue: 2,0:24:04.73,0:24:13.01,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.5}那一天 我回握了那只手
Comment: 0,0:23:27.13,0:23:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.16,0:23:14.21,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}在另一侧 今天仍有人
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.32,0:23:20.16,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}日渐颓败 却仍然站立
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.35,0:23:26.07,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}刺痛胸口的这份寂寞
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.20,0:23:31.92,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}点或是线 断断续续
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.92,0:23:34.99,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}面具碎裂
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.99,0:23:37.95,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}那无法回避的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.95,0:23:40.97,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}不得不活下去
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.97,0:23:45.66,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HA7A7A7&}明天已经在等待
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.66,0:23:51.25,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无边无际 却又如此短暂
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.25,0:23:57.42,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就当作心这种东西 根本不存在吧
Dialogue: 1,0:23:57.65,0:24:00.68,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耀眼得难以直视
Dialogue: 1,0:24:00.68,0:24:04.73,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}柔软的手心
Dialogue: 1,0:24:04.73,0:24:13.01,Jigoku_ED2CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那一天 我回握了那只手
Comment: 0,0:23:29.13,0:23:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,
